# Node 패키지: 안드로이드 빌드에 필요한 Capacitor 부품 4개만 저장소에 넣어요
node_modules/*
!node_modules/@capacitor/
node_modules/@capacitor/*
!node_modules/@capacitor/android/
!node_modules/@capacitor/app/
!node_modules/@capacitor/filesystem/
!node_modules/@capacitor/share/
node_modules/@capacitor/*/ios/
node_modules/@capacitor/*/*.podspec
node_modules/@capacitor/*/Package.swift

# 빌드 결과물·개인 설정
.DS_Store
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
www/_compose.html
